      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I noticed that VRC_ObjectSync does not synchronize animation parameters too. This might be relevant with the issue.\n\nI made a minimum reproduction world and uploaded the world with Unity 2017.4.28f1 and 2018.4.12f1.\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_d16dbefc-d6b4-41e2-8579-79ac3b1e7540&instanceId=10352~private(usr_672fdd70-3d7b-4202-8dee-cc9582786773)~nonce(b2eabf63-649c-4b73-8a5f-be9049755d21)\n\nReproduction Steps:\n- Visit the world with someone else\n- Master player interact with the switch (This Local-OnInteract trigger changes the animation parameter)\n- All player should see the rotating box's animation change (But on beta client, non-master players don't see the animation change.)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
