  "details": "I uploaded an existing world for 2018 open beta.\nThen, I tested the world on a recent beta build, It seems like VRC_Panorama with VRC_DataStorage does not sync.\nThe problem happened in following situation:\n1. VRC_Panorama is attached to the quad.\n2. VRC_DataStorage is attached automatically (but data element is set up for VRC_Panorama)\n3. VRC_ObjectSync is also attached to the same quad.\n\nI called VRC_Panorama.NextPano() via a uGUI button, It looks like the Panorama displays the next image for the owner player.\nHowever, Panorama does not display the next image for other players.\nIf other players joined,  They will see an image that visible for the owner at the time.",
